  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support a parametric (index-based) weather risk insurance pool that will provide participating African countries with predictable, quick-disbursing funds with which to implement pre-defined contingency response plans in the case of a drought.</narrative>
